{{Quote|I have faith in the New Republic.''"<br />"''And that faith will be tested.''"<br />"''Your face will be tested when I kick in your teeth.|Wedge Antilles and Yupe Tashu|<ref name="Aftermath">[[Aftermath (novel)|''Aftermath'']]</ref>}}
[[File:DryaxHead-TBB-FlashStrike.png|thumb|right|300px|A [[dryax]] with a mouth of sharp teeth.]]
'''Teeth''' were an anatomical feature found in many [[species]] throughout [[the galaxy]]. Teeth were generally found in the [[mouth]], where they were used to chew [[Foodstuff|food]] before its entry into the digestive system. The [[Gungan]] species had large, blunt teeth which enabled them to crack open edible [[shellfish]].<ref name="SWE Gungans">{{SWE|groups|gungans|Gungans}}</ref> [[Gender|Male]] [[Twi'lek]]s traditionally filed their teeth into sharp points.<ref name="Twi'lek Culture">{{SW|url=news/star-wars-inside-intel-twilek-culture|text=''Star Wars'' Inside Intel: Twi'lek Culture|int=Star Wars Inside Intel}}</ref>

